'' A const initialised from lbound/ubound needs a bound known at compile time (fbc error
'' 11): a dynamic array has none, and a variable dimension argument means fbc cannot tell
'' which bound is asked for. A fixed array folds, and a plain DIM takes any of them.
'' Matches fbc on lines 15 and 16 (reported in the other order -- the dimension test runs
'' in Resolve and the array test in the post-Check pass).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/const-array-bound.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' GOLDEN: expected/const-array-bound.out
